","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miri’s the other close friend of the group that the club starts around. In general she’s the sporty angry tsundere type girl. She tends to have violent moments, but mostly directed (justly) at Shigeo. If it weren’t for her, Shigeo wouldn’t get nearly as much punishment as he deserves. Incidentally, she is quite amazing drunk. Miri and Shigeo are friends with Yukako and Atsushi since middle school days."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is actually childhood friends with Atsushi"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Agilis's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1568"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"由佳子の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はっきりとした性格の元気っコで、主人公とはケンカ友達。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに実家は地元で有名な料理店。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24564","sourceWorkId":"8460","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"由佳子の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はっきりとした性格の元気っコで、主人公とはケンカ友達。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに実家は地元で有名な料理店。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21404"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93ac5e7ebeb634919cd49eaf63d296d618745cab8d8394edbee8e5664c169e12.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a88fcc7aed7fa05327387490c1c5d935f3dc19ca403b823ce65f0f95c7f943e1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21865:21404:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1570","characterName":"小早川　円","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21405","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21865"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24565"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1570"},"originalCharacterName":"小早川　円","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"606"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The winner of the first character popularity contest, She’s the oldest of the bunch, and acts like the big-sister most of the time. She really loves hugging, squeezing, and generally crushing people to her massive chest, to which everyone (especially Celes) can only think of as torturous punishment. She is Atsushi childhood friend and acts like a big sister towards him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Agilis's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1570"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の先輩で、才色兼備な学園の生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スキンシップが大好きで、主人公を何かと子ども扱いする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24565","sourceWorkId":"8460","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の先輩で、才色兼備な学園の生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スキンシップが大好きで、主人公を何かと子ども扱いする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21405"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/035a103b4c9b250a896f37491e056047075c3026b6586ee07d273fea47b65cda.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f8136de0d524e35b4c36f817f1524e02aa20c1a9e92a967024fbc5b278e1f51.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"やなせなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21865:21405:4714:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1571","characterName":"セリス・アルフォード","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21406","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21865"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24566"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1571"},"originalCharacterName":"セリス・アルフォード","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1107"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A half-blooded girl who transfers in. She’s also a tsundere girl, and a sheltered ojou-sama to boot. Her natural prettiness overcomes Madoka and so she’s often being hugged to death. Her main feature, is that she finds bad puns hilarious, and will constantly try to make new ones up. The worse the pun, the louder she’ll laugh."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Celes is in some way similar to Atsushi in middle school as they tried to close their heart as they always have to transfer schools."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In Celes Route, Her father allowed her to stay as what her father wants for her is her happiness and as long as she doesn't regret it and has found her happiness, he is fine with her staying. In the end, she goes to England with her dad but returns a year later. She promises to return."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Agilis's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1571"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の理事長を父に持つ、ハーフのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はクールぶっているがもすぐムキになる負けず嫌いな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は笑い上戸で、くだらないギャグに弱い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24566","sourceWorkId":"8460","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の理事長を父に持つ、ハーフのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はクールぶっているがもすぐムキになる負けず嫌いな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は笑い上戸で、くだらないギャグに弱い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21406"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34a88861237587df622bc12e4678a83df9751763575343dcd21572bba74d995c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4bcb6a7f4283e4c128f5d3003e844eb4a0704b8f7d2b532f12baa10077668e9a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤咲かおり","creatorId":"vndb:s1182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1182","name":"韮井叶","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21865:21406:6105:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1569","characterName":"渡部 敦志","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1569"},"originalCharacterName":"渡部 敦志","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character, spent most of his childhood moving from city to city, lives with his mother near Yukako. He treated Yukako coldly in his middle school days."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Agilis's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1569"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/te